  "notes": "A literary and dramatic word frequently seen in fiction, fantasy, and nature documentaries. Also functions as a する verb ({咆哮|ほうこう}する).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{咆哮|ほうこう}を{上|あ}げる — to let out a roar\n・{咆哮|ほうこう}が{響|ひび}く — a roar resounds\n・{怒|いか}りの{咆哮|ほうこう} — roar of anger\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{雄叫|おたけ}び — war cry, battle cry\n・{唸|うな}り — growl, snarl (lower intensity)",
